{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironwing Valiant is a fast-pace, mecha action-JRPG game with shooting and melee mechanics, mech customization, companion customization, real-time with pause command abilities in combat, and a compelling storyline and characters.\u00a0Taking the guise of a young mecha pilot named Reinhardt, you will battle through sleepy villages, imposing fortress cities, and war-scarred industrial centers, fully customize your Valiant (our term for mecha) to fit your playstyle. The game features full parts customization (Head, Arms, Legs, Core, minor components), a large selection of unique melee, ranged, and axillary weapons, companion and party customization, multiple enemy types (Infantry, armored vehicles, mechs, elite enemies, and more) and a JRPG-style storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/2525fb6a2b30122e2330edf89452a5b1.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the many arts of Mecha combat-- Fight in melee and ranged combat with a diverse arsenal of weapons that include: cannons, missile launchers, swords, axes, shields, and much more! Two distinct archetypes will define your role on the battlefield: soar through the skies and fight in the air, or generalize and become the jack of all trades, able to react to whatever any opponent throws your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/11fe2d91f26d6d948ee87ba65e06e435.poster.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/11fe2d91f26d6d948ee87ba65e06e435.webm?t=1754380862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/11fe2d91f26d6d948ee87ba65e06e435.mp4?t=1754380862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/7f0a1e3e4de4352a339f23e3e9e0b890.poster.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/7f0a1e3e4de4352a339f23e3e9e0b890.webm?t=1754380862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/7f0a1e3e4de4352a339f23e3e9e0b890.mp4?t=1754380862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/2525fb6a2b30122e2330edf89452a5b1.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream mecha-- Customize to your heart\u2019s content! Swap out the Heads, Core, Arms, Legs, Power pack, and more components to make your perfect build with its own, unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/fc2e60dbb8e2a0ab28b8bfff715bc686.poster.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/fc2e60dbb8e2a0ab28b8bfff715bc686.webm?t=1754380862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/fc2e60dbb8e2a0ab28b8bfff715bc686.mp4?t=1754380862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/2525fb6a2b30122e2330edf89452a5b1.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NARRATIVE:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironwing Valiant\u2019s story takes place in the world of Euridia, in the small mountain Kingdom of Astera. The world and story of Ironwing Valiant is based off of Chinese and Korean mythology and The Romance of The Three Kingdoms novel! Defend your homeland and fight for your small kingdom's independence against the Gundrian Empire! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/667257535fa382b6aac64dd2e6c35937.poster.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/667257535fa382b6aac64dd2e6c35937.webm?t=1754380862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/667257535fa382b6aac64dd2e6c35937.mp4?t=1754380862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/2525fb6a2b30122e2330edf89452a5b1.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTERS:</strong><br>Follow the efforts a young Valiant pilot named Reinhardt and his friends as they struggle to defend their homeland from the Empire of Gundria! Bring one of your three combat companions into the fray, customize their loadouts and abilities, and grow your bond with them to increase their battlefield prowess!<strong>\u00a0</strong>Hold dear your friends, cherish moments of peace, and fight as one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/ae4dd1019cdb61286724afa6983e2b94.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=537 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/b1f682139792d28aba8227b601707e49.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=537 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/2525fb6a2b30122e2330edf89452a5b1.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore A Beautiful World:</strong>Venture through Astera! From the imposing Fortress City of Suhl, to the Sixteen Heavenly peaks of the Lonely Mountains, the quiet village of Brunheim, and the bustling city of Voclau! Start your journey in the sleepy village of Brunheim, a Ghibli-esque village of warm-hearted people, rolling country hills, windmills that dot these blessed lands and a divine wind rolls across the heavens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/eea4fea4d33e8065d77b7436cc9f03d9.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=397 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871670/extras/2525fb6a2b30122e2330edf89452a5b1.avif?t=1754380862\" width=800 height=58 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871670?t=1754380862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac